{"unit_id":"Sanqi-normal__dsh-model-picker#card-zh","repo":"Sanqi-normal/dsh-model-picker","commit":"0c02710f9fd704ce5fba9cc65082330876d1f83f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker 是面向 DSH Web 的模型选择器插件，在对话输入区提供左右分栏的选择面板：左侧浏览提供商，右侧查看并选择模型，两列可独立滚动。它支持跨提供商搜索模型、提供商名称和模型描述，也能在模型支持时调整推理档位；界面沿用每个会话共享的模型目录，提供加载与选择状态。适合需要快速浏览多个模型提供商并切换会话模型的 Web 用户。它通过 Web 客户端插槽替换 composer 的模型选择座位；需 Web 端提供模型目录服务，不要求插件单独配置密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:130-143","lib/client.js:195-224","lib/client.js:374-401"]}
{"unit_id":"Sanqi-normal__dsh-model-picker#card-en","repo":"Sanqi-normal/dsh-model-picker","commit":"0c02710f9fd704ce5fba9cc65082330876d1f83f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-picker upgrades the DSH Web composer picker with a provider column and model list. Search spans provider and model names and descriptions. Users can switch models and supported reasoning efforts. It reuses the session model directory and requires the Web model-directory service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:130-143","lib/client.js:195-224","lib/client.js:374-401"]}
